          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. For each QEMU virtual machine, one dedicated physical CPU core must be reserved."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. QEMU uses the concept of virtual CPUs to map the virtual machines to physical CPUs."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. QEMU virtual machines support multiple virtual CPUs in order to run SMP systems."
